intel-dpcpp (6.2.0-0ubuntu1~26.04~ppa5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * d/rules, d/control: enable LTO support for compiler.
  * d/rules: misc fixes for dh v13.
  * d/compat: remove in favor of debhelper-compat in BuildDepends.
  * d/control: create unified runtime libraries binary packages.
  * d/copyright: overhaul to align with upstream LLVM.
  * d/*.install: migrate unified runtime libs to their own binary packages.
  * d/*.install: move public libs to conventional location.
  * d/*.lintian-overrides: suppress warning about missing man pages.
  * d/s/lintian-overrides: suppress UTC license error as this is also done
    in upstream LLVM.

